[22:23.29]Now, the sale of a ¡ê1 million house no longer causes surprise, nor is it likely to be the subject of a newspaper article.
[22:34.60]What exactly can we expect to get today£¿
[22:39.57]Well, first of all, space, of course. 
[22:43.76]Living in large cities has made us all tired of living in those crowded little houses and flats built just after the war. 
