[24:26.69]The Barbican is also for those who like living high up, accommodation being situated mostly in tower blocks. 
[24:36.52]St. John's Wood, on the other hand, is favored mostly by upper-middle-class families who prefer a detached house surrounded by a walled garden, thus ensuring their privacy. 
[24:51.56]Gardens, of course, tend to raise the price of a property. 
